    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No. 4 Castlegrange Park, a stunning mid-terraced residence presented in superb condition throughout with the added benefit of an attic conversion.  This beautifully maintained home offers bright, spacious accommodation combined with stylish finishes, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families, or investors alike. \r\nFrom the moment you step inside, the sense of light and space is evident, with well-proportioned rooms designed for modern living.  The property has been tastefully decorated and is truly in showhouse condition. \r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious living room filled with natural light, and a well-appointed kitchen/dining area with access to rear garden.  Upstairs hosts three generously sized bedrooms (one ensuite) and a family bathroom. The attic is converted and is presently used as a 4th bedroom. \r\nThe large rear garden is a great feature of this home. Enjoying a sunny orientation, it has an outside tap and electrical point and offers a perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining, or relaxing in a private environment.\r\nCastlegrange Park is ideally positioned within this highly sought-after development, just minutes from a host of local amenities including;\r\n•\tHansfield Rail Station, Ongar Village \r\n•\tExcellent bus links \r\n•\tSuperValu Shopping Centre\r\n•\tPrimary and secondary schools  \r\nThe area also benefits from easy access to Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, the M50, and Dublin City Centre. \r\nNumber 4 Castlegrange Park presents a rare opportunity to acquire a turnkey home in a prime residential location with future potential. Combining style, space, and convenience, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\twith solid wood flooring, under-stairs storage featuring lights and shoe rack, integrated spotlights, radiator cover, cupboard unit and alarm control panel  \r\n\t\r\nLounge:\tfeature inset fireplace with electric fire, solid wood flooring, fitted wall shelves, and IKEA remote controlled spotlights \r\n4.8x3.1m \t     \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room: L shaped with modern fitted kitchen featuring wall and floor mounted units,   tiled splash-back, tiled floor, integrated spotlights, IKEA controlled kitchen under-cupboard lighting, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher, American fridge, oven and hob, under-sink water descaler unit, fitted wall shelves and French doors to west facing rear garden \r\n4.8x4.3m\t   \t\r\n\r\nGuest W.C: with W.C and W.H.B, under sink storage unit, partially tiled walls and tiled floor  \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: with fitted wardrobes, laminate wood floor and radiator cover  \r\n4.2x3.4m\r\n\r\nEnsuite:   with Mira electric shower, W.C and W.H.B, under sink storage unit, integrated spotlights, fully tiled walls and tiled floor \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: with fitted wardrobes, fitted wall shelves and laminate wood floor  \r\n4.0x2.6m\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: with fitted wardrobes, fitted wall shelves and cubes, laminate wood floor \r\n3.2x2.2m\r\n\r\nBathroom:  with bath with shower attachment, W.C and W.H.B, partially tiled walls and tiled floor  \r\n2.0x1.8m\t\r\n\r\nLanding: \twith hotpress and laminate wood floor \r\n\r\nAttic: with Velux windows, laminate wood floor, storage in eaves and integrated spotlights, wardrobe and fitted shelves  \r\n4.8x4.8m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Outside\r\nLandscaped garden to front with communal on street car-parking  \r\nWest facing rear garden fenced and laid out in lawn with wooden decked area \r\nOutside tap and power-points  \r\nWooden garden shed\r\n\r\n\r\nServices\r\nGFCH with Hive control \r\nMain water descaler system \r\nIKEA home automation hub \r\nIKEA controlled spotlights at front door \r\nRing doorbell \r\nPVC Double glazed windows\r\nAnnual Service Charge c. €270\r\n\r\nLocal Area Information\r\nPublic transport routes that service Castlegrange:\r\nBus: 39/39A – Train: Hansfield and Clonsilla Rail Stations\r\nNearby Areas: Clonee Village, Ongar Village, Clonsilla and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre"
      },
